<title>SPAIN: BCH studies offers for its 49.9 pct in Azucarera.</title>
<headline>BCH studies offers for its 49.9 pct in Azucarera.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano said that it had received on Monday three purchase offers which combined would cover its entire 49.9 percent stake in sugar refiner Azucarera.</p>
<p>The offers are from Mercasa, Caja de Salamanca and sugar refiner Ebro.</p>
<p>&quot;We have received today three separate offers for the purchase of all of our stake,&quot; a spokeswoman for the bank said. &quot;We will study the offers.</p>
<p>Under Spanish law, a public offering must be made for stakes of more than 25 percent.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
